WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:20.639 --> 00:00:24.096
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

2
00:00:25.075 --> 00:00:28.012
EPISODE 12

3
00:00:30.629 --> 00:00:31.928
I see you're happy.

4
00:00:32.388 --> 00:00:35.205
Yes, I'm glad. I'm very, very happy.

5
00:00:38.861 --> 00:00:39.960
Even...

6
00:00:40.779 --> 00:00:42.278
won't you say anything?

7
00:00:43.337 --> 00:00:47.233
"Cool", "I'm delighted" -
at least something like that.

8
00:00:47.652 --> 00:00:49.910
Of course it was cool!

9
00:00:52.208 --> 00:00:53.307
How much?

10
00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.582
Wow so much.

11
00:00:58.961 --> 00:01:00.300
Come on. Badly?

12
00:01:17.223 --> 00:01:18.482
That much?

13
00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:21.718
Wow. Yes, it was very cool.

14
00:01:25.495 --> 00:01:29.431
Can I sing for Sol,
when will you be back?

15
00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:31.469
To make her fall in love.

16
00:01:35.964 --> 00:01:37.822
Do you want to make me fall in love with songs?

17
00:01:41.638 --> 00:01:42.737
Certainly.

18
00:01:44.196 --> 00:01:45.295
And also...

19
00:01:45.554 --> 00:01:46.893
I want at least once...

20
00:01:47.233 --> 00:01:49.251
perform on stage again.

21
00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:51.728
Did you like it?

22
00:01:52.707 --> 00:01:54.925
Maybe I really liked it, or maybe...

23
00:01:55.385 --> 00:01:58.442
I realized what awaits me
in the future - I don’t know.

24
00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:00.999
But one thing I'm sure of -

25
00:02:02.378 --> 00:02:03.477
my heart began to pound.

26
00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:05.555
Here you go. What did I say?

27
00:02:07.932 --> 00:02:09.031
And one more thing.

28
00:02:09.251 --> 00:02:12.068
Look. Dali after the performance.

29
00:02:12.527 --> 00:02:16.663
This is CEO Kim's business card, right?

30
00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:18.182
And what is he?

31
00:02:18.801 --> 00:02:19.900
Well...

32
00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:23.057
Said he wanted to pick up the Eclipse
to your agency.

33
00:02:23.357 --> 00:02:24.655
Is it true?

34
00:02:24.995 --> 00:02:27.608
How nice, Sung Jae! Great!

35
00:02:27.632 --> 00:02:28.731
Are you so happy?

36
00:02:28.831 --> 00:02:30.410
Certainly.

37
00:02:30.629 --> 00:02:34.126
You can't imagine how worried I was,
that I'm disturbing you.

38
00:02:35.385 --> 00:02:37.083
Don't be stupid.

39
00:02:40.819 --> 00:02:42.438
You know, Sung Jae...

40
00:02:43.217 --> 00:02:44.875
There is nothing more to dream of.

41
00:02:46.454 --> 00:02:47.553
Really?

42
00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:51.269
I wish...

43
00:02:52.088 --> 00:02:53.706
time passed more slowly.

44
00:03:01.798 --> 00:03:03.177
The trees have already bloomed.

45
00:03:24.655 --> 00:03:25.794
Sorry.

46
00:03:26.254 --> 00:03:27.712
Where's my dad?

47
00:03:28.212 --> 00:03:30.230
A detective has been brought to you.

48
00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:32.707
The last chamber is around the corner.

49
00:03:45.754 --> 00:03:46.853
Dad...

50
00:04:02.777 --> 00:04:03.876
Are you crying?

51
00:04:10.969 --> 00:04:12.667
I just yawned.

52
00:04:14.246 --> 00:04:16.739
Wow! Dad? I didn't notice you.

53
00:04:16.763 --> 00:04:18.537
Are you standing and mourning your father?

54
00:04:18.561 --> 00:04:20.659
I? When did this happen?

55
00:04:21.678 --> 00:04:24.571
I came here on business
how did you end up here?

56
00:04:24.595 --> 00:04:27.648
Here's a dreamer. He got worried and came running.

57
00:04:27.672 --> 00:04:29.886
They called me and said
that a person is dying.

58
00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.289
I came running!

59
00:04:31.389 --> 00:04:33.646
I have 20 stitches on my forehead...

60
00:04:33.826 --> 00:04:35.804
and a couple of bruises on the neck.

61
00:04:36.224 --> 00:04:39.437
Your dad is Captain Immortality,
just know that.

62
00:04:39.461 --> 00:04:40.919
What other Captain?

63
00:04:41.019 --> 00:04:42.318
Not even an officer.

64
00:04:44.376 --> 00:04:46.629
Tell me what happened?

65
00:04:46.653 --> 00:04:49.866
Murder suspect
at the Juyang Reservoir

66
00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.824
They arrested him and are now taking him to the police station.

67
00:04:51.848 --> 00:04:54.901
The detainee managed to escape
from the police and now...

68
00:04:54.925 --> 00:04:57.658
Lord, Lord, what's going on.

69
00:04:57.682 --> 00:05:00.935
It's good that he was caught.
This is not a person.

70
00:05:00.959 --> 00:05:05.490
Kim is wanted throughout the country
judicial authorities are involved.

71
00:05:05.514 --> 00:05:08.048
Broken? Dad, there's something wrong with the door.

72
00:05:08.072 --> 00:05:12.723
What? Leave it, we'll figure it out later.
Dad is watching the news now.

73
00:05:12.747 --> 00:05:15.281
The approximate height of the criminal is 180 cm,

74
00:05:15.305 --> 00:05:17.882
Eye color - brown, strong build.

75
00:05:17.982 --> 00:05:19.476
- If you see him...

76
00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.673
- Kim Young Soo?
-...let me know immediately.

77
00:05:22.697 --> 00:05:26.190
On the screen you now see
photo of the criminal.

78
00:05:26.214 --> 00:05:29.027
If you notice him,
report to the police.

79
00:05:29.051 --> 00:05:31.868
The suspect's name is Kim Young Soo.

80
00:05:32.368 --> 00:05:36.260
We urge Kim's victims
contact immediately

81
00:05:36.284 --> 00:05:38.821
to law enforcement agencies.

82
00:05:41.838 --> 00:05:44.496
Murder suspect
at the reservoir.

83
00:05:44.635 --> 00:05:46.334
Kim Young Soo.

84
00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:52.767
Dad will catch Kim Young Soo soon,
That's all!

85
00:06:16.444 --> 00:06:18.741
What? Will he come here?

86
00:06:18.961 --> 00:06:21.135
Yes. May 10.

87
00:06:21.159 --> 00:06:24.452
Will you be able to keep watch somewhere nearby?

88
00:06:24.476 --> 00:06:26.574
10th? What will happen?

89
00:06:27.273 --> 00:06:29.251
Are you afraid that he will come for you?

90
00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:32.563
He won't go where he was caught
red-handed.

91
00:06:32.587 --> 00:06:33.686
Maybe...

92
00:06:34.426 --> 00:06:35.604
...and he will climb.

93
00:06:35.944 --> 00:06:40.400
Salt, don't worry
Everything is done for your safety.

94
00:06:40.819 --> 00:06:42.434
Talk to your family.

95
00:06:42.458 --> 00:06:45.630
Maybe you should move away for a while.
Will it be better this way?

96
00:06:45.654 --> 00:06:48.272
If Kim Young Soo notices the detectives,

97
00:06:48.731 --> 00:06:49.870
they won't catch him.

98
00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:53.946
It's not about my experiences.
Yeon Soo needs to be detained.

99
00:06:54.286 --> 00:06:55.465
What are you...

100
00:06:55.924 --> 00:06:58.302
are you thinking of luring him here?

101
00:06:58.482 --> 00:07:00.659
No way. It's dangerous.

102
00:07:01.479 --> 00:07:03.616
You're just about to grab it.

103
00:07:05.235 --> 00:07:09.047
- What... What are you planning?
- I really want to explain to you,

104
00:07:09.071 --> 00:07:11.405
what's going on, but I really can't.

105
00:07:11.429 --> 00:07:13.606
Please don't ask anything

106
00:07:13.706 --> 00:07:14.805
but just...

107
00:07:15.225 --> 00:07:16.440
...help.

108
00:07:16.464 --> 00:07:19.401
Consider yourself protecting me.

109
00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:21.159
That's the only way...

110
00:07:21.978 --> 00:07:23.676
you will catch him.

111
00:07:53.666 --> 00:07:56.004
What happened that day?

112
00:07:58.941 --> 00:08:02.917
She said, think only about yourself.

113
00:08:03.177 --> 00:08:08.268
All this happened because of your stupidity!

114
00:08:08.292 --> 00:08:10.386
Don't notice me. And don't worry.

115
00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:14.102
Wherever I am, whatever I do
and no matter what happens...

116
00:08:14.126 --> 00:08:16.863
Forget me, Sung Jae. Please...

117
00:08:18.921 --> 00:08:20.939
Whatever happens, Sol...

118
00:08:22.877 --> 00:08:24.655
I won't leave you alone.

119
00:08:29.391 --> 00:08:31.289
Why don't you ask for help?

120
00:08:39.061 --> 00:08:40.719
Geum!

121
00:08:43.377 --> 00:08:45.595
My God. How cute!

122
00:08:47.413 --> 00:08:50.585
- Hyun Joo!
- Geum!

123
00:08:50.609 --> 00:08:52.663
I missed you!

124
00:08:52.687 --> 00:08:55.465
I miss you too! Very, very strong!

125
00:09:11.508 --> 00:09:15.285
Hyun Joo! Hyun Joo! Hyun Joo! Hyun Joo!

126
00:09:15.544 --> 00:09:16.843
Yes, Sung Jae!

127
00:09:19.021 --> 00:09:20.919
Hyun Joo! How are you?

128
00:09:23.936 --> 00:09:27.469
Horror. Did you eat something wrong?

129
00:09:27.493 --> 00:09:29.267
Why did you jump into the water?

130
00:09:29.291 --> 00:09:31.469
- What are you, Non Ge?
- No.

131
00:09:31.768 --> 00:09:35.824
I just saw Sol coming here.
And I got scared.

132
00:09:36.324 --> 00:09:37.463
Has she already passed?

133
00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:40.939
We were saved.

134
00:09:41.399 --> 00:09:44.571
Well, here it is, my treasure.
What would you do without me?

135
00:09:44.595 --> 00:09:45.970
And don't talk.

136
00:09:45.994 --> 00:09:48.931
You are my only one, princess.

137
00:09:51.229 --> 00:09:52.328
Wait...

138
00:09:52.827 --> 00:09:54.566
We were completely wet.

139
00:09:55.744 --> 00:09:56.879
It's cold, right?

140
00:09:56.903 --> 00:09:59.321
Shall we hug? Shall we hug?

141
00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:00.799
Cold.

142
00:10:01.019 --> 00:10:02.598
Very cold.

143
00:10:10.689 --> 00:10:13.742
- Do you have a pair?
- Not anymore. It was cancelled.

144
00:10:13.766 --> 00:10:16.544
They should have told us earlier. Textbooks are hard.

145
00:10:17.163 --> 00:10:18.262
Let's.

146
00:10:19.401 --> 00:10:20.500
Let's go.

147
00:10:25.475 --> 00:10:27.612
Mother! Grandmother!

148
00:10:31.349 --> 00:10:32.887
Lim Geum!

149
00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:41.119
Is there anyone at home?

150
00:10:42.697 --> 00:10:43.956
I'll come in.

151
00:10:53.407 --> 00:10:55.500
Wait here. I'll take the textbooks.

152
00:10:55.524 --> 00:10:56.863
Let's see.

153
00:10:57.562 --> 00:10:59.740
What? It is forbidden!

154
00:11:03.197 --> 00:11:05.535
There's nothing to see here, that's it.

155
00:11:06.673 --> 00:11:08.052
I'm interested.

156
00:11:08.272 --> 00:11:10.330
What kind of room does Lim Sol have?

157
00:11:11.269 --> 00:11:14.645
It's not always such a mess here.
I usually clean up.

158
00:11:17.542 --> 00:11:19.201
Not quite tight.

159
00:11:19.381 --> 00:11:21.155
We need to put up a grate.

160
00:11:21.179 --> 00:11:22.278
What?

161
00:11:23.776 --> 00:11:25.235
Is the window closing?

162
00:11:27.093 --> 00:11:28.907
Yes, sure.

163
00:11:28.931 --> 00:11:30.470
Close it at night.

164
00:11:31.049 --> 00:11:34.026
Further. Where's your stun gun?

165
00:11:34.286 --> 00:11:35.744
- Come here.
- What?

166
00:11:41.239 --> 00:11:42.617
- This?
- Yes.

167
00:11:53.746 --> 00:11:55.405
Put it under your pillow.

168
00:12:04.336 --> 00:12:06.114
What's wrong with you?

169
00:12:06.374 --> 00:12:08.791
Suddenly someone comes up to you.

170
00:12:09.371 --> 00:12:10.470
Gorgeous.

171
00:12:13.766 --> 00:12:15.465
Do you know such words?

172
00:12:16.763 --> 00:12:18.502
Who will come to me?

173
00:12:27.153 --> 00:12:28.252
Who's there?

174
00:12:31.189 --> 00:12:33.407
Sol has a liberal arts background.

175
00:12:33.506 --> 00:12:36.044
They were cancelled. What to do?

176
00:12:36.943 --> 00:12:39.321
Sit here. I'm on a reconnaissance mission.

177
00:12:42.138 --> 00:12:43.876
The hair got caught!

178
00:12:44.336 --> 00:12:45.475
Carefully.

179
00:12:48.452 --> 00:12:49.551
So.

180
00:12:57.083 --> 00:12:59.021
Stay here. Don't go out.

181
00:13:14.146 --> 00:13:15.245
Sorry.

182
00:13:15.864 --> 00:13:17.323
He said don't go out!

183
00:13:36.444 --> 00:13:37.543
It seems...

184
00:13:38.801 --> 00:13:40.220
the door was open.

185
00:14:32.468 --> 00:14:34.126
What is it?

186
00:14:37.582 --> 00:14:39.281
- Nobody?
- Nobody.

187
00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:41.399
Let's go out.

188
00:14:50.849 --> 00:14:51.948
So.

189
00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.737
It's dangerous here, call the police.

190
00:15:43.996 --> 00:15:45.095
Fine.

191
00:16:13.726 --> 00:16:17.622
- Stand-I-I-I-I-I-yat!
- God!

192
00:16:18.402 --> 00:16:19.501
No!

193
00:16:32.228 --> 00:16:35.325
God!

194
00:16:39.261 --> 00:16:40.360
You?

195
00:17:00.759 --> 00:17:02.298
Scoundrel.

196
00:17:03.237 --> 00:17:04.336
Salt!

197
00:17:04.675 --> 00:17:06.489
How did your tongue turn?

198
00:17:06.513 --> 00:17:09.646
I knew it. Yes. I knew it!

199
00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:11.005
Are you chasing my friend?

200
00:17:11.029 --> 00:17:13.207
No, Sol, it’s me who’s behind him...

201
00:17:13.387 --> 00:17:15.565
What were you doing here?

202
00:17:15.624 --> 00:17:17.359
And Hyun Joo, why are you wearing my clothes?

203
00:17:17.383 --> 00:17:19.876
We fell into the lake and went to change clothes.

204
00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:21.634
Everyone judges for himself!

205
00:17:21.658 --> 00:17:24.432
What about you? What were you doing here?

206
00:17:24.456 --> 00:17:26.953
I helped Sol carry her textbooks.

207
00:17:27.413 --> 00:17:30.470
And just like that, no one was home!
Great!

208
00:17:31.289 --> 00:17:35.500
Have you brought your supplies again?
How many? 300 pieces?

209
00:17:35.524 --> 00:17:37.299
I explained that these are not mine!

210
00:17:37.323 --> 00:17:39.341
He explained! Be silent!

211
00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:40.979
Little sister.

212
00:17:41.838 --> 00:17:43.736
Let's resolve everything peacefully.

213
00:17:44.356 --> 00:17:48.487
I give you permission to meet.
And you give us permission.

214
00:17:48.511 --> 00:17:50.050
Even if you are against...

215
00:17:50.549 --> 00:17:51.848
we don't care.

216
00:17:52.148 --> 00:17:55.640
How do you talk to your older brother?

217
00:17:55.664 --> 00:17:57.798
Since when are you his big brother?

218
00:17:57.822 --> 00:18:01.559
Don't do that, Sol. He's older.
Be more polite.

219
00:18:01.738 --> 00:18:04.596
By... By... More politely?

220
00:18:05.175 --> 00:18:06.713
Wow!

221
00:18:08.691 --> 00:18:09.990
Don't be angry, don't be angry.

222
00:18:11.848 --> 00:18:15.141
Of course, in the whole world
takes care of me

223
00:18:15.165 --> 00:18:17.778
only my princess Hyun Joo!

224
00:18:17.802 --> 00:18:19.377
My treasure.

225
00:18:19.401 --> 00:18:22.458
Why are you in this house
no one respects you?

226
00:18:23.956 --> 00:18:25.375
Shameless!

227
00:18:26.354 --> 00:18:28.008
You're asking for it!

228
00:18:28.032 --> 00:18:31.045
- I can arrange it again!
- Calm down.

229
00:18:31.069 --> 00:18:32.723
- I can’t!
- Take it away.

230
00:18:32.747 --> 00:18:34.641
- What if I don’t clean it up?
- Take it away!

231
00:18:34.665 --> 00:18:36.164
I'll hit!

232
00:18:43.896 --> 00:18:47.433
What an asshole. I told her so many times!

233
00:18:48.811 --> 00:18:51.349
If you don't like it, stop them.

234
00:18:52.488 --> 00:18:55.185
Something goes, something comes.

235
00:18:55.325 --> 00:18:56.619
Everything has a price.

236
00:18:56.643 --> 00:18:58.378
I wouldn't get married -

237
00:18:58.402 --> 00:19:00.899
I wouldn’t see my bunnies.

238
00:19:02.597 --> 00:19:05.295
I don't think I can decide to do this.

239
00:19:06.913 --> 00:19:09.531
Apparently, fate itself brought them together.

240
00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:13.646
If you try and fate doesn't change,

241
00:19:14.306 --> 00:19:16.044
This means it is a conscious choice.

242
00:19:17.423 --> 00:19:21.119
Sometimes we make a decision
already knowing the result.

243
00:19:21.858 --> 00:19:23.357
It suits us.

244
00:19:26.733 --> 00:19:28.032
You are right.

245
00:19:28.372 --> 00:19:32.308
They have the right to choose.
Can I interfere?

246
00:19:33.566 --> 00:19:35.704
They like each other.

247
00:19:35.924 --> 00:19:37.622
They probably like it.

248
00:19:38.961 --> 00:19:40.735
By the way, what about the contract?

249
00:19:40.759 --> 00:19:42.578
In Hyuk hasn't answered me yet.

250
00:19:42.837 --> 00:19:45.495
I can't get through to him.

251
00:19:45.754 --> 00:19:47.249
Did something happen?

252
00:19:47.273 --> 00:19:48.572
I'm worried.

253
00:19:53.107 --> 00:19:55.205
Who cares about whom?

254
00:19:59.181 --> 00:20:00.280
Salt...

255
00:20:00.939 --> 00:20:02.038
you know...

256
00:20:07.852 --> 00:20:09.471
No, forget it.

257
00:20:30.909 --> 00:20:32.288
May 10.

258
00:20:32.428 --> 00:20:35.720
Will you be able to keep watch somewhere nearby?

259
00:20:35.744 --> 00:20:36.843
Maybe...

260
00:20:37.542 --> 00:20:38.721
he will appear.

261
00:20:39.141 --> 00:20:40.759
May 10.

262
00:20:52.767 --> 00:20:54.825
GYMA VIDEO AND DVD

263
00:21:02.957 --> 00:21:04.056
Baek In Hyuk!

264
00:21:05.554 --> 00:21:06.773
What is this?

265
00:21:16.464 --> 00:21:18.322
In Hyuk, were you sitting at home?

266
00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:21.559
Who's there?

267
00:21:25.135 --> 00:21:27.353
- Morning.
- What have you forgotten here?

268
00:21:29.530 --> 00:21:31.389
In Hyuk moved out of here.

269
00:21:31.808 --> 00:21:33.626
Now this is my office. And what?

270
00:21:35.684 --> 00:21:37.223
Hello Sol.

271
00:21:37.762 --> 00:21:38.861
How are you...

272
00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:41.658
Have you moved out of here?

273
00:21:41.878 --> 00:21:42.977
Why suddenly?

274
